+  return <><WikiHeader /><main className="project-page">
+    <header className="project-page-hero"><span>Access and pricing</span><h1>Free to read. Free to contribute.</h1><p>The public encyclopedia is ad-free and evidence-linked. Researcher profiles, claims, and submissions are free and subject to identity checks and editorial review.</p></header>
